  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Basic Infrastructure Support Mechanism (BISM) addresses the small and medium infrastructure needs of USAID-funded programs in health, democracy and governance, education, youth, water and wastewater, energy, and economic growth sectors. BISM ensures infrastructure improvements are implemented in accordance with best engineering practices...</narrative>
